    TEST-0001: test the 2-hour limit and overlaps with the fake file system
    
    FakeFileSystem hands book() whatever JSON a test gives it, and
    remembers what book() wrote. Each new test starts from a file with
    Sam's 10:00–12:00 booking in IKB-261, and checks both the answer and
    that nothing was written.

